# Ocean View Resort - UML Diagrams

This document contains visual representations of the system architecture and core workflows using Mermaid.js syntax.

## 👥 Use Case Diagram

```mermaid
useCaseDiagram
    actor Guest
    actor Receptionist
    actor Admin

    package "Resort Management System" {
        usecase "Register/Login" as UC1
        usecase "Search & View Rooms" as UC2
        usecase "Book Room (Self)" as UC3
        usecase "Cancel Booking" as UC4
        usecase "View Personal History" as UC5
        
        usecase "Check-In / Check-Out" as UC6
        usecase "Process Payment & Generate Bill" as UC7
        usecase "Manage Room Availability" as UC8
        usecase "View Dashboard Stats" as UC9
        usecase "Manage Staff Accounts" as UC10
    }

    Guest --> UC1
    Guest --> UC2
    Guest --> UC3
    Guest --> UC4
    Guest --> UC5

    Receptionist --> UC1
    Receptionist --> UC6
    Receptionist --> UC7
    Receptionist --> UC8
    Receptionist --> UC3

    Admin --|> Receptionist
    Admin --> UC9
    Admin --> UC10
```

---

## 🏗️ Detailed Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class User {
        +int userId
        +String username
        +Role role
        +boolean active
        +login()
    }
    class Role {
        <<enumeration>>
        ADMIN
        STAFF
        RECEPTIONIST
    }
    
    class Guest {
        +int guestId
        +String email
        +String contactNumber
        +IdType idType
        +getFullName()
    }
    class IdType {
        <<enumeration>>
        NIC
        PASSPORT
        DRIVING_LICENSE
    }

    class Room {
        +int roomId
        +String roomNumber
        +RoomType roomType
        +BigDecimal ratePerNight
        +boolean available
    }
    class RoomType {
        <<enumeration>>
        STANDARD
        DELUXE
        OCEAN_VIEW
        SUITE
        PENTHOUSE
    }

    class Reservation {
        +int reservationId
        +String reservationNumber
        +LocalDate checkInDate
        +LocalDate checkOutDate
        +Status status
        +long getNumNights()
    }
    class Status {
        <<enumeration>>
        PENDING
        CONFIRMED
        CHECKED_IN
        CHECKED_OUT
        CANCELLED
    }

    class Bill {
        +int billId
        +BigDecimal roomCharges
        +BigDecimal taxAmount
        +BigDecimal totalAmount
        +PaymentStatus paymentStatus
    }
    class PaymentStatus {
        <<enumeration>>
        PENDING
        PAID
        PARTIAL
    }

    User --> Role
    Guest --> IdType
    Room --> RoomType
    Reservation --> Status
    Bill --> PaymentStatus

    Guest "1" -- "*" Reservation : makes
    Room "1" -- "*" Reservation : assigned to
    Reservation "1" -- "0..1" Bill : generates
    User "1" -- "*" Reservation : manages
```

---

## 🔄 Sequence Diagram 1: User Login

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Guest/Staff
    participant S as AuthServlet
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant DAO as UserDao / GuestDao
    participant DB as MySQL DB

    User->>S: POST /api/auth/login (credentials)
    activate S
    S->>AS: login(username, password)
    activate AS
    AS->>DAO: findByUsername(username)
    activate DAO
    DAO->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE ...
    DB-->>DAO: ResultSet
    DAO-->>AS: Optional<User>
    deactivate DAO
    
    AS->>AS: Verify Password (BCrypt)
    AS->>DAO: updateLastLogin(id)
    AS-->>S: User Object
    deactivate AS
    
    S->>S: Create HTTP Session
    S-->>User: 200 OK (JSON User Data)
    deactivate S
```

---

## 🔄 Sequence Diagram 2: Add New Reservation

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant RS as ReservationServlet
    participant SVC as ReservationService
    participant RDAO as ReservationDao
    participant RMDAO as RoomDao
    participant SUB as ReservationSubject

    Client->>RS: POST /api/reservations (details)
    activate RS
    RS->>SVC: create(guestId, roomId, in, out, ...)
    activate SVC
    
    SVC->>RMDAO: findById(roomId)
    RMDAO-->>SVC: Room Data
    
    SVC->>RDAO: isRoomAvailable(roomId, in, out)
    RDAO-->>SVC: true
    
    SVC->>RDAO: insert(reservation)
    RDAO-->>SVC: success
    
    SVC->>RMDAO: setAvailability(roomId, false)
    
    SVC->>SUB: notifyObservers(CREATED_EVENT)
    activate SUB
    SUB-->>SVC: Done
    deactivate SUB
    
    SVC-->>RS: Reservation Object
    deactivate SVC
    RS-->>Client: 201 Created (JSON)
    deactivate RS
```

---

## 🔄 Sequence Diagram 3: Calculate and Print Bill

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant RS as ReservationServlet
    participant SVC as ReservationService
    participant SUB as ReservationSubject
    participant OBS as BillingObserver
    participant BS as BillingService
    participant BDAO as BillDao

    Staff->>RS: PUT /api/reservations/{id}/confirm
    activate RS
    RS->>SVC: confirm(reservationId)
    activate SVC
    
    SVC->>SVC: transition(CONFIRMED)
    SVC->>SUB: notifyObservers(CONFIRMED_EVENT)
    
    activate SUB
    SUB->>OBS: onEvent(event)
    activate OBS
    OBS->>BS: generateBill(reservationId)
    activate BS
    BS->>BS: Calculation: (Nights * Rate) + 10% Tax
    BS->>BDAO: insert(bill)
    BDAO-->>BS: success
    BS-->>OBS: Bill Object
    deactivate BS
    OBS-->>SUB: done
    deactivate OBS
    SUB-->>SVC: done
    deactivate SUB
    
    SVC-->>RS: Success
    deactivate SVC
    RS-->>Staff: 200 OK (Updates UI)
    deactivate RS
    
    Note over Staff, BDAO: Printing is handled by formatting the Bill JSON in JS and calling window.print()
```
